A cluster

The `Cluster` holds the `Ingress`, the `Web pod` and the `Worker pod`. The
`Ingress` sends to the `Web pod`, with the label `route`. The `Web pod` sends
to the `Queue`, with the label `jobs`. The `Queue` is outside the `Cluster`.
The `Worker pod` reads the `Queue`, with the label `read`.
---
Cluster { Ingress, Web pod, Worker pod }
Ingress -> Web pod: route
Web pod -> Queue: jobs
Worker pod -> Queue: read
